WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:08.560
Vidiyo a na-enye mmeghe nkenke maka ngwaọrụ Arclight.

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.520
Jiri bọtịnụ isi awọ gbanye ya.

3
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:18.440
Na mbụ, njedebe abụọ nke Arclight nwere ike ịbịa n'otu oge.

4
00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:24.580
Ọ bụrụ na ọ gbanwughị ma ọ bụ ọkụ anaghị anyụ anyụ, batrị nwere ike ịdị larịị.

5
00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:27.360
Jiri chaja USB jikọọ ya.

6
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.240
Mgbe ị na-akwụ ụgwọ, ọkụ ndụ ndụ ga-abịa.

7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Mgbe nkeji iri na ise gachara, a ga-akwụ ya ụgwọ zuru oke ma rụọ ọrụ ruo ọtụtụ awa.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Ịhapụ ya na ìhè anyanwụ ga-eme ka batrị chajị.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Ị gaghị adị mkpa dochie batrị ma ọ bụ bọlbụ ọ bụla.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
Ụdị mgbe njedebe abụọ ahụ batara bụ maka ojiji n'ozuzu ya.

11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Gbanwee na ọnọdụ anya site na ijide bọtịnụ ala maka 15 sekọnd.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Welite mkpịsị aka gị wee pịa ngwa ngwa ọzọ ka ọkụ na-enwu.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Ị nọ ugbu a na ọnọdụ anya, ebe ophthalmoscope ga-abịa

14
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.940
mbụ, mgbe ahụ, ihu akụkụ loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Imegharị usoro ndị a ga-agafe n'ụdị ojiji atọ dị iche iche.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
Iji izugbe, anya, wee ntị.

17
00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:20.080
Ozugbo ịhọrọla ọnọdụ kachasị amasị gị, pịa bọtịnụ isi awọ

18
00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:25.520
na-agbanwe otú ọkụ na-enwu na nke njedebe ka ọkụ.

19
00:01:25.520 --> 00:01:30.140
Jide n'aka na ị na-eji njedebe ziri ezi maka nyocha ziri ezi.

20
00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:34.700
A na-enyocha anya mpụga site na iji loupe.

21
00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:41.140
Echiche ahụ ga-edo anya mgbe ị dị nso na anya na gburugburu 6 cm.

22
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:48.300
A na-eme reflex fundal n'ogologo aka site na iji ophthalmoscope ozugbo.

23
00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:53.740
Ọ bụrụ na eleghi anya, lelee anya lens dị n'elu.

24
00:01:54.160 --> 00:02:00.540
N'ọnọdụ a, ọ dịghị oghere na oghere anya na reflex kwesịrị doro anya.

25
00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.180
Enwere ike iji Arclight were weghara vidiyo nke akara ụlọ ọgwụ

26
00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.760
mgbe etinyere na igwefoto ekwentị mkpanaaka.

27
00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:57.810
Ozugbo etinyere ya, oghere anya nke ophthalmoscope ozugbo

28
00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:05.920
a ga-etinye ya ozugbo n'etiti etiti oghere igwefoto mkpanaka gị na-eji na ọnọdụ vidiyo.

29
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:11.800
Igwefoto ga-arụ ọrụ dị ka anya gị mgbe ị na-elele oghere anya.

30
00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.720
Iji gosi nke enyo iji kwado oghere anya,

31
00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:21.760
mepee ngwa vidiyo na ekwentị gị, tinye mkpịsị aka gị n'elu oghere ọ bụla n'aka nke ya.

32
00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:27.100
Mgbe ihuenyo gbara ọchịchịrị, ị kpuchiri oghere ejiri maka vidiyo.

33
00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:31.960
Wepu akwụkwọ edo edo n'azụ mkpachị ahụ.

34
00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:38.180
Debe isi ihe nke akụ ahụ n'elu etiti oghere eji ewepụta vidiyo.

35
00:03:39.360 --> 00:03:41.040
Pịa obere vidiyo ahụ nke ọma.

36
00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:43.150
Wepu akụ.

37
00:03:44.210 --> 00:03:47.410
Ihe mkpachị ahụ kwesịrị ịdị ugbu a n'ọnọdụ ziri ezi.

38
00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:51.470
Iji vidiyo reflex, gbanye ophthalmoscope ozugbo

39
00:03:51.690 --> 00:03:56.770
njedebe nke Arclight wee họrọ ọkụ kachasị na-egbuke egbuke na ịpị atọ.

40
00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:59.310
Gbaa mbọ hụ na oghere oghere dị n'elu.

41
00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:03.820
Ka ọkụ chere ihu na ekwentị chere onye ọrịa ahụ.

42
00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:09.840
tinye Arclight n'ime obere vidiyo ma dọrọ ihe na-agbanwe agbanwe ka ọ chekwaa ya.

43
00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:14.840
Pịa Arclight elu ruo mgbe ọ nweghị ike ịfefe ọzọ.

44
00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:17.380
Oghere anya nke ophthalmoscope ozugbo

45
00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:23.560
ga-anọ ugbu a ozugbo n'etiti etiti oghere na-ese vidiyo.

46
00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:28.460
Ka ịdekọ anya mpụga, jiri akụkụ nke ọzọ nke ngwaọrụ ahụ.

47
00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:34.160
Ka ịse foto, mepee ngwa vidiyo wee bugharịa,

48
00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.020
na-ejuputa ihuenyo na nlele site na oghere anya.

49
00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:41.000
Pịa ndekọ wee mee nyocha ahụ.

50
00:04:41.480 --> 00:04:43.220
Pịa kwụsị ma chekwaa vidiyo.

51
00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.200
Ị nwere ike ịkekọrịta ugbu a n'etiti ndị ọrụ ibe gị na nyiwe echedoro, ezoro ezo

52
00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:53.260
naanị maka ebumnuche nke ị nwetara nkwenye n'aka onye ọrịa.

53
00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:19.890
Nwee obi ụtọ iji Arclight n'ọrụ gị.
